		{
			dependencies: ["202D27DC120594C9"]
			description: [
				"&eMounted over a chemical vat, the industrial mixer agitates the batch when fitted with a mixer blade and supplied with rotation. Agitation brings reactants into contact and distributes them through the mixture, which is why many cracking and polymer reactions require it.&r"
				""
				"&eMixing does not replace heat or a suitable vessel; those remain separate requirements of the reaction.&r"
